flowchart TD
    Start[Investigation Start] --> InputType{Indicator Type?}
    InputType -- IP Address --> CheckTor[Tor Exit Node Check]
    InputType -- Domain --> CheckWhois[WHOIS / RDAP Lookup]
    
    CheckTor --> CheckASN[ASN & GeoIP Resolution]
    CheckASN --> CheckAbuse[AbuseIPDB Reputation]
    
    CheckWhois --> ResolveDNS[DNS Resolution / DoH]
    ResolveDNS --> SubdomainEnum[Subdomain & CNAME Enum]
    
    CheckAbuse --> ThreatIntel[OTX / TI Indicator Match]
    SubdomainEnum --> ThreatIntel
    
    ThreatIntel --> Report[Generate Attribution Report]
